<title>USA: Mattel Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Mattel Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>March 31,    1997	   March 31,1996</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $    0.72    profit  $     0.07</p>
<p> Net loss	    204,624    profit     20,534</p>
<p> Revs		  693,520		  683,999</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Primary income per share for 1997 quarter before the $0.73 per share effect of the merger-related non-recurring charge of $210 million after taxes, was $0.01 per share.</p>
<p>Share and per share data for all periods presented reflect the retroactive effect of shares issued pursuant to Tyco deal.  </p>
<p>Consolidated results for all periods are restated for the merger with Tyco Toys Inc.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 includes $275 million in non-recurring charge for transaction, integration and restructuring costs related to the Tyco merger. The related tax benefit of $65 million is included in the provision for income taxes.</p>
<p>MATTEL Q1 earnings summary pre-merger</p>
<p> Shr		  $	0.05	    $    0.11</p>
<p> Net		   13,123		     29,885</p>
<p> Revs		  568,528		   585,879</p>
<p>NOTE: Consolidated results exclude Tyco and all merger-related transactions.</p>
